Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: add Kaspa-style finality horizon and spent-undo
 pruning

Track the Avalanche/proof-of-work finality horizon in DiskStateStore and
prune historical spent-coin undo records deeper than the finality window.
